  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot Talent for Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the knowledge and skills from ten young local civil servants from the Middle East and North Africa-region (MENA), enabling them to improve their abilities for better service delivery and the development of their local community, by providing them with training (content wise and skills), tools and practical experience through an internship at a Dutch municipality.</narrative>
